Automatically protect root apps using the live KernelSU policy

Retain the policy owner through all hook drains, keep manual extras transactional, and enable root/RMGU selection at module initialization. Preserve PR 158 wrapper, credential and error semantics; add production-C concurrency and lifetime regressions plus exact ARM64/BZJA evidence.
